{"data":{"body":"**P1 \u2014 Recheck scope fatals after end hooks.** A timed-out handler can report a `VirtualMachineError` or `ThreadDeath` while `onInvocationEnd` is blocked. Because the fatal is checked only before dispatch, `execute()` can still return PENDING/RETRYING while the error escapes only on a detached worker. Recheck `scopeFatal` after end dispatch and MDC restoration, and require the invocation caller to receive the original fatal when it occurs before the hook returns.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc76gpEa","finding_digest":"d43371534e39ba8ef3db8885e66b122c9182a4cc77f87519192245519be87d31","finding_id":"arf_v1_2qzxcu2ohg5i5463rcc6m2ysfs","finding_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::awaithandlerscopes::fatal-cleanup-propagation","identity_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::awaithandlerscopes::fatal-cleanup-propagation","line":375,"observation_digest":"622a065f2cfe21a13fd6fc425eeca2992b12ecb45b03b88e2c8b41e994e6b4d3","observation_id":"aro_v1_mivamxzm7yq2cp6w7rbf53fcte","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/DurableExecutor.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_2qzxcu2ohg5i5463rcc6m2ysfs","published_at":"2026-10-07T03:48:13Z","review_id":"arr_v1_ekllxnu4djuih5h7pu7bhlf4jo","reviewed_base_sha":"34c174f2819f715cf26e88aa8dbabd7d40cb9ad8","reviewed_head_sha":"2412f4a505bab6d2ef897b53df2ee01cabfddbdd","reviewer":"codex","start_line":375,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":769},"record_id":"art_v1_slox6dde3crryjdb4n33pnzzfk","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-07T03:48:13Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
